==Trivia==
*The examine text is a reference to the first line of the nursery rhyme: {{WP|This Little Piggy}}.
*It is the lowest level monster with access to the [[rare drop table]] and will roll the [[gem drop table]] relatively often for its low level. This means they may be of interest for low level [[Ironman Mode|ironmen]] hunting for drops such as the [[shield left half]] and [[dragon spear]]. Compared to [[Gorak|Goraks]] or [[Burst spells|burstable]] monsters such as [[Dust devil|Dust devils]] this is a lot slower, however.

